category: Text
requires: bash cygwin libapertium3 libgcc1 libicu76 libintl8 liblttoolbox3 libstdc++6 libxml2_2 python3
sdesc: "Free/open-source machine translation platform (utilities)"
ldesc: "Apertium is a free/open-source machine translation platform, initially aimed
at related-language pairs but expanded to deal with more divergent language
pairs (such as English-Catalan)."

